commit 11e5e77b6	a planner price of the heap row of a plain index scan (0.1 us a row, measured 146 ns a row of a clustered table) held by test/sql/col_point_dir.sql (failing first: the lookup of an equality on a bool, 16,853 rows, took the index scan at 1.55 ms where the index-only scan takes 1.08)
